    "Nominal LeRobot10fps with live20Hz does not resample numerical action labels: dataset requests integer index offsets and each action remains one20Hz controlstep. It is misleading timing metadata, but not evidence of factor2 scaling of actions. Public no-op removal may shorten elapsed time between retained steps.",
